          "title": "Kopfschmerzen: a headache",
          "body": "**der Schmerz** = pain. You'll nearly always hear the plural, **Schmerzen**.\n\nPut a body part in front to make one long word: *Kopf* + *Schmerzen* = **Kopfschmerzen** (headache). Say it with **haben** and no article:\n\n- *Ich habe **Kopfschmerzen**.* = I have a headache.\n- **Bauchschmerzen** = stomach ache\n- **Halsschmerzen** = a sore throat\n\n**das Fieber** = fever, a temperature. Also with *haben*: *Ich habe Fieber.*",
