          "id": "hl4-e4",
          "type": "TEACH",
          "title": "bleiben and zu Hause",
          "body": "- **bleiben** = to stay. It's regular: *ich bleibe, du bleibst, er bleibt*.\n- **zu Hause** = at home. Learn it as one fixed phrase.\n- **im Bett** = in bed\n\nWith *sollen*, **bleiben** goes to the end: *Ich soll zu Hause **bleiben**.*",
          "examples": [
            { "text": "Ich bleibe heute zu Hause.", "translation": "I'm staying at home today." },
            { "text": "Du sollst zu Hause bleiben.", "translation": "You should stay at home." },
