          "id": "hl4-e6",
          "type": "TEACH",
          "title": "sollen or müssen?",
          "body": "- **müssen** = must, have to. It's necessary: *Ich **muss** arbeiten.* (I have no choice.)\n- **sollen** = should, be supposed to. Someone tells or advises you: *Ich **soll** im Bett bleiben.* (The doctor says so.)\n\nTo ask for advice: **Was soll ich machen?** = What should I do?",
